[[Celestial skill]]s can be temporarily acquired by player [[character]]s and [[henchmen]] in the [[Imperial Sanctum]] mission, [[Raisu Palace]] mission and [[Raisu Palace (explorable area)|explorable area]]. They are acquired by talking to the dragon [[Kuunavang]]. The skill differs between primary [[profession]]s.

==Celestial skills==
{{skill table|category=celestial skills|show profession=y}}

==Notes==
* Those whose primary profession comes from the [[Nightfall]] campaign (either [[Paragon]] or [[Dervish]]) will default to Celestial Summoning.

{{anomaly|Celestial skills' descriptions omit that they can only be recharged when gaining a [[Morale Boost]].}}
{{bug | The Celestial skill recharge gained from Morale Boosts will not take effect if the Celestial skill is hidden by another skill bar, such as that provided by [[Ursan Blessing]].}}

